# Presence of this file excludes apps/anchor from ALL Nucleus discovery:
# the registry API, nginx/compose generation (infra/generate.js), and the
# hub-library symlink step (infra/production).
#
# Anchor is a privileged infrastructure control plane, NOT a Nucleus app. It
# lives under apps/ for organizational reasons only and runs as its own,
# independent Docker Compose project. See ARCHITECTURE.md.
